      "text": "UA 857 is the only nonstop, and United Polaris business on it comes three ways, priced for the whole round trip with taxes:\n\n- United Polaris, Base (Most restrictive): $11,240. No changes, choose your lie-flat seat for a fee, and no Polaris lounge (United Club only).\n- United Polaris: $11,640. No change fees, choose your lie-flat seat, Polaris lounge access and 2 checked bags included.\n- United Polaris, Flexible (Fully refundable): $21,827, the same plus a full refund if your plans change.\n\nThe standard fare is $400 more than the basic one for the lounge, a second bag and free seat choice.",
